sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.business-trips.create)"
    participant Controller as "Employee BusinessTripController"
    participant Model as "BusinessTrip Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Isi formulir lalu klik Ajukan Permohonan
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/business-trips
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi input + file lampiran
    Controller->>Model: BusinessTrip::create(data)
    Model->>DB: INSERT business_trips + supporting_document_path
    DB-->>Model: Data perjalanan dinas tersimpan
    Model-->>Controller: Permohonan berhasil dibuat

    alt Data valid (tanggal, durasi, file, dan field wajib valid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi pengajuan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (validasi gagal / tanggal salah / file invalid)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal mengajukan perjalanan dinas
    end
